# Case-study visual system

- Treat `/es/case-studies/food-beverage` as the canonical visual reference.
- Build every sector with the existing `SectorPortfolio` and `WorkProjectBlock` system.
- Build every portfolio case with the existing `PortfolioProjectCanvas` system.
- Preserve the desktop composition first: large media, generous spacing, restrained copy, three-column rows, typography, colors, motion, and hover-to-unfold behavior.
- Adapt the same hierarchy to tablet and mobile without changing the desktop design or introducing horizontal scroll.
- Reuse existing components, tokens, navigation, locale routing, metadata, and CTA patterns.
- Keep ES, EN, and DE content structurally aligned with natural translations.
- Use only approved text, images, links, and metrics. Never invent results.
- Validate at 1440, 1280, 768, 430, and 390 px before publishing.
- Publish through the existing Git/Vercel project and verify the production URLs.
